        	<span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Repealed by ORD C35468</span><span style="font-size:13.5pt;
        color:black"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, January 23, 2017</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, March 5, 2017</p><p>ORD C35468 Section 3</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=04.25B.060">Section 04.25B.060</a> REPEALED (Charter)<br />
        <p>
        	<span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Repealed by ORD C35468</span><span style="font-size:13.5pt;
        color:black"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, January 23, 2017</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, March 5, 2017</p><p>ORD C35468 Section 3</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=04.25B.070">Section 04.25B.070</a> REPEALED (Effect of Issuance of Charter)<br />
        <p>
        	<span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Repealed by ORD C35468</span><span style="font-size:13.5pt;
        color:black"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, January 23, 2017</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, March 5, 2017</p><p>ORD C35468 Section 3</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=04.25B.080">Section 04.25B.080</a> REPEALED (Board of Directors)<br />
        <p>
        	<span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Repealed by ORD C35468</span><span style="font-size:13.5pt;
        color:black"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, January 23, 2017</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, March 5, 2017</p><p>ORD C35468 Section 3</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=04.25B.090">Section 04.25B.090</a> REPEALED (Organizational Meeting)<br />
        <p>
        	<span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Repealed by ORD C35468</span><span style="font-size:13.5pt;
        color:black"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, January 23, 2017</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, March 5, 2017</p><p>ORD C35468 Section 3</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=04.25B.100">Section 04.25B.100</a> REPEALED (Meetings of the Board of Directors)<br />
        <p>
        	<span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Repealed by ORD C35468</span><span style="font-size:13.5pt;
        color:black"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, January 23, 2017</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, March 5, 2017</p><p>ORD C35468 Section 3</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=04.25B.110">Section 04.25B.110</a> REPEALED (Quorum)<br />
        <p>
        	<span style="font-size: 9pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Repealed by ORD C35468</span></p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, January 23, 2017</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, March 5, 2017</p><p>ORD C35468 Section 3</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=04.25B.120">Section 04.25B.120</a> REPEALED (Board Review and Concurrence)<br />
        <p>
        	<span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Repealed by ORD C35468</span><span style="font-size:13.5pt;
        color:black"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, January 23, 2017</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, March 5, 2017</p><p>ORD C35468 Section 3</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=04.25B.130">Section 04.25B.130</a> REPEALED (Charter Amendments)<br />
        <p>
        	<span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Repealed by ORD C35468</span><span style="font-size:13.5pt;
        color:black"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        
